<metadata><name>Snowlands 1023 Woods Lake</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 4; or continue as broken (legs do not join end to end). 3.6 miles round trip to lake and 4.8 miles round trip with addition of extension to Lost Cabin Mine. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/10/1023_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
